            <ArticleTitle>[A large ovarian teratoma mimicking acute abdomen--case report].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>345-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Authors present case report of an adolescent girl with the large ovarian teratoma. Teratoma of the ovary was surprising finding during laparotomy which was indicated on the basis of acute abdomen. Tumorectomy was performed. Microscopic examination revealed differentiated mature teratoma. There were no signs of recurrence. Authors present short review of the literature concerning this rare diagnosis and the reason of acute abdomen.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
